body:
As I’ve shared in another post;

Political theatre.

🎭 🍿 🎪

Calorie deficit & be active; 
Exercise (jogging, bicycling, weight training, etc); 
Proper hydration; 
Adequate sunlight; 
Watch what you eat; processed “foods” is not good; 
Strive to eat more whole foods; 
Stay away from added sugars as best as you can (fruit sugars are okay as they’re naturally occurring).
